<title>BELGIUM: Belgium blocks counterfeit Smurf invasion.</title>
<headline>Belgium blocks counterfeit Smurf invasion.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian customs have beaten back an invasion of counterfeit Smurfs from China.</p>
<p>The customs said on Friday they had seized a consignment of more than 33,000 of the popular Belgian cartoon characters on their way from China to France.</p>
<p>The seizure last week was followed by another of 11,000 garden gnomes with fake trademarks. The total weight of the haul was 40 tonnes.</p>
</text>
